{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_55_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_55","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年，春，公伐戎。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_55_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_55","textTraditional":"二、夏，公至自伐戎。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_55_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_55","textTraditional":"三、曹殺其大夫。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_55_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_55","textTraditional":"言大夫而不稱名姓，無命大夫也。無命大夫而曰大夫，賢也，為曹羈，崇也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_55_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_55","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會宋人、齊人伐徐。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_55_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_55","textTraditional":"五、冬，十有二月，癸亥，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}